  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回到开头的 Aztec Connect。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的 Aztec Connect。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.904,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.662
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "它已经弃用，管理员密钥已经放弃，合约里却仍然有钱。",
   "spoken": "它已经弃用，管理员密钥已经放弃，合约里却仍然有钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.724,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 4.822,
   "speechEnd": 9.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "证明按 32 笔交易一组校验。",
   "spoken": "证明按 32 笔交易一组较验。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.368,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 10.466,
   "speechEnd": 12.942
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "L1 上的结算，只处理到一个字段写的笔数。",
   "spoken": "L1 上的结算，只楚理到一个字段写的笔数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.996,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 14.094,
   "speechEnd": 16.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "这个字段，没有和证明绑定，由攻击者填写。",
   "spoken": "这个字段，没有和证明绑定，由攻击者填写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.032,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 18.13,
   "speechEnd": 21.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "攻击者把它设成 1。伪造的存款不被记账，证明仍然有效。",
   "spoken": "攻击者把它设成 1。伪造的存款不被记账，证明仍然有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.812,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 22.91,
   "speechEnd": 28.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "按 rekt.news、SlowMist 和 Halborn 的分析，第一名攻击者取走约 219 万美元，第二名又取走约 8.8 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按 rekt.news、SlowMist 和 Halborn 的分析，第一名攻击者取走约 219 万美元，第二名又取走约 8.8 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.08,
   "dur": 9.768,
   "speechStart": 29.178,
   "speechEnd": 38.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "安全研究者的结论是，问题在证明和结算之间的绑定。",
   "spoken": "安全研究者的结论是，问题在证明和结算之间的绑定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.068,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 39.166,
   "speechEnd": 43.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "所以结算要用证明里的全部公开输入。数量、索引、长度，也必须被证明覆盖。",
   "spoken": "所以结算要用证明里的全部公开输入。数量、索引、常度，也必须被证明覆盖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.184,
   "dur": 7.824,
   "speechStart": 44.282,
   "speechEnd": 51.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "已经弃用的合约，要么彻底停用，要么继续放在监控和赏金范围里。",
   "spoken": "已经弃用的合约，要么彻底停用，要么继续放在监控和赏金范围里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 52.228,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 52.326,
   "speechEnd": 57.695
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "同样的问题，放大到整条 L2。",
   "spoken": "同样的问题，放大到整条 L2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.736,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 58.834,
   "speechEnd": 61.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "欺诈证明的 Rollup，假设挑战期里至少有一个诚实的挑战者，提款要等几天。",
   "spoken": "欺诈证明的 Rollup，假设挑战期里至少有一个诚实的挑战者，提款要等几天。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.364,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 62.462,
   "speechEnd": 68.509
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "有效性证明的 Rollup，假设证明系统可靠、电路正确，提款通常几小时。",
   "spoken": "有效性证明的 Rollup，假设证明系统可靠、电路正确，提款通常几小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 69.568,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 69.666,
   "speechEnd": 75.832
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "两种证明系统，都能被运营方切换或暂停，链也能回滚。",
   "spoken": "两种证明系统，都能被运营方切换或暂停，链也能回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 76.892,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 76.99,
   "speechEnd": 81.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "2024 年 8 月，OP Mainnet 的故障证明在审计中发现漏洞，守护者把它切回许可模式。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 8 月，OP Mainnet 的故障证明在审计中发现漏洞，守护者把它切回许可模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 82.656,
   "dur": 7.968,
   "speechStart": 82.754,
   "speechEnd": 89.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 的证明层发现状态不一致，拒绝出证明，链回滚约 1.5 小时。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 的证明层发现状态不一致，拒绝出证明，链回滚约 1.5 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 90.844,
   "dur": 7.992,
   "speechStart": 90.942,
   "speechEnd": 98.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "L2BEAT 的 Stages 框架，按去掉运营方之后剩下多少保障，给 L2 分级。",
   "spoken": "L2BEAT 的 Stages 框架，按去掉运营方之后剩下多少保障，给 L2 分级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 99.056,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 99.154,
   "speechEnd": 104.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "Stage 越低，安全越依赖运营方和多签。",
